flowchart LR
    O["Owner notebook<br/>SK_owner + PK_owner"]
    I["Input ciphertext<br/>encrypted to PK_owner"]
    C["Compute notebook<br/>no secret keys"]
    R["Encrypted scalar result<br/>sum / mean / variance"]
    G["Isolated release boundary<br/>allowlist + audit"]
    RK["Ephemeral PRE re-key<br/>owner → analyst"]
    A["Analyst<br/>SK_analyst"]
    P["Plain aggregate result"]

    O -->|encrypt| I
    I --> C
    C -->|HE evaluation| R
    R --> G
    O -->|owner secret authority| G
    A -->|analyst public key only| G
    G -->|ReKeyGen; never export| RK
    RK -->|ReEncrypt approved result| G
    G -->|released ciphertext| A
    A -->|decrypt| P

    I -. "SK_analyst cannot decrypt" .-> A
    C -. "must not receive PRE re-key" .-> RK
